份合成探針收進 `tests/release-evidence/20261008-coordination/`。\r\n\r\n`51793afba2848a7f5b187255d815d62ce4da38ef` 更正過期 head，並把收尾清單放在 `open-work-index.md`。沒有另開報告，沒有關 issue，沒有合併。\r\n\r\n- 作者自述與來源核對分開。第三階段瀏覽器包在 #173 `457eade18`，本 PR 沒有重跑；`results.json` 是 32 通過、1 失敗，最終輪 `NODE_EXIT 1`。\r\n- 實際執行的兩支原生測試在 #171 `fd5b8c8`，不在本 PR。\r\n- 三條缺口裡，正式規則線的清空後載入已另有原生測試。共用 `roundtrip()` 與 `sleep(250)` 仍未改。`space_model_test.js` 的 GEO244 重開斷言不在 `b0ef9bc` 的 diff 裡；該提交改的是保存重開入口與點擊捲動。\r\n- 歷史 10／155 仍缺。`51793af` 的 CI run `37805006118` 是 7 jobs、0 steps。\r\n\r\n`1127531f3aab472e01a4a99c03ef7b739b1b8ae5` 把 #174 更新為 `b0ef9bc`。那次瀏覽器收據是來源核對，本 PR 沒有重跑。檢查當時 CI run `37805921660` 仍在佇列，不把還沒出現的 steps 寫成 0。\r\n\r\n雲端請讀 #171 `fd5b8c8`、#174 `b0ef9bc`、#175 `1127531`，以及 #173 的 `tests/release-evidence/20261008-phase3-formal/`。不要讀本機 D: 或 Temp。\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2026-10-08T15:19:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-08T16:06:25Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e0963f8b2e842c5e71162c557f9f3e639caef00d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pulls/175/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pulls/175/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/175/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/statuses/1127531f3aab472e01a4a99c03ef7b739b1b8ae5","head":{"label":"ZhiQiYang:docs/runbook-index-20261008","ref":"docs/runbook-index-20261008","sha":"1127531f3aab472e01a4a99c03ef7b739b1b8ae5","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://ap